  initialPage: 0
  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 22 | One Way Only | Circuit Overview
    explanation: 'ILLUSTRATIVE / NOT LIVE VERIFIED. One series current path: Battery_positive
      -> SW1 -> R1 330 Ohm -> D1 anode -> D1 banded cathode -> green LED anode ->
      green LED cathode -> Battery_negative. The diode permits forward current and
      blocks reverse current. No direct parallel bypass wire should connect across
      the diode or LED.'
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | 5 V | SWITCH | 330 OHM | DIODE | GREEN LED
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.52}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
    - id: sw1
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.27, y: 0.8}
      label: SW1
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.78, b: 0.28, a: 1}
