  - title: LEVEL 22 | Exact Five Electrical Wires
    explanation: 'CONNECT THESE FIVE WIRES: (1) Battery_positive -> Switch Input.
      (2) Switch Output -> R_LIMIT_Input. (3) R_LIMIT_Output -> D_PROTECT_Anode.
      (4) D_PROTECT_Cathode -> LED_INDICATOR_Anode. (5) LED_INDICATOR_Cathode ->
      Battery_negative. These are runtime binding IDs; use the actual SparkTerminal
      GameObjects when drawing wires. The banded diode cathode points toward the
      LED anode. If Battery_positive -> switch is prewired, the player places only
      the four remaining wires.'
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | WIRE TERMINAL TO TERMINAL | DIODE BAND TOWARD LED
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.52}
