  - title: LEVEL 22 | Correct Solution & Four Targets
    explanation: 'DESIGN ESTIMATES / NOT LIVE SOLVER READINGS. With approximately
      0.7 V diode drop, 2.1 V green LED drop and 330 Ohm resistor, series current
      is approximately 6.67 mA. Targets: 5 V supply between 4.8 and 5.2 V; forward
      diode drop 0.45 to 1.0 V; green LED ON; resistor current 5 to 8 mA. Required
      runtime bindings: D_PROTECT_Component / D_PROTECT_Anode / D_PROTECT_Cathode;
      R_LIMIT_Component / R_LIMIT_Input / R_LIMIT_Output; LED_INDICATOR_Component
      / LED_INDICATOR_Anode / LED_INDICATOR_Cathode. Only SparkLevelEvaluator awards
      4/4; verify actual currents with the electrical audit.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | 5 V | DIODE 0.45-1.0 V | LED ON | 5-8 mA
